Hello,

Probably off-topic but you can automate switching from "\\" to "/".
If run on Windows, normalizePath uses "\\".
Then, chartr it translates to "/".


path <- normalizePath("~")
chartr("\\", "/", path)


Hope this helps,

Rui Barradas


